# Validated phosphonate corrections transcribed from the corrected Me-4PACz file.
# These explicit lines override LigParGen values after deterministic type remapping.
# Updated LigParGen ordering: P=19, P=O oxygen=20, P-OH oxygens=21/22,
# and the corresponding acidic hydrogens=39/40. Values remain verbatim
# (to displayed precision) from the corrected single-Me-4PACz force field.
